But, he came to save me.

560
00:53:39,196 --> 00:53:41,156
Min Hwal-sung is the one
who fell from the roof, right?

561
00:53:42,366 --> 00:53:43,367
Yes.

562
00:53:47,496 --> 00:53:49,873
What? Is there something wrong?

563
00:53:53,502 --> 00:53:55,128
Your husband has passed away.

564
00:54:05,430 --> 00:54:06,682
What do you mean?

565
00:54:08,141 --> 00:54:09,852
I just told you.

566
00:54:11,854 --> 00:54:13,814
Hwal-sung came
to Seyoon Building.

567
00:54:14,565 --> 00:54:17,608
So I thought he was dead,
but he came back alive.

568
00:54:17,609 --> 00:54:18,569
To save me.

569
00:54:19,319 --> 00:54:20,112
That's...

570
00:54:21,238 --> 00:54:22,865
Let's just stop here for today.

571
00:54:42,509 --> 00:54:43,718
So,

572
00:54:43,719 --> 00:54:46,846
Jeon Yi-gyeong hired Jang Dong-chul
from Loan Heaven

573
00:54:46,847 --> 00:54:48,515
to kidnap Da-rae, right?

574
00:54:50,267 --> 00:54:52,852
Has the analysis finished
for the Hye-yun Company CCTV?

575
00:54:52,853 --> 00:54:54,395
Yes, almost done...

576
00:54:54,396 --> 00:54:56,147
Okay,
first check the relationship

577
00:54:56,148 --> 00:54:57,357
between Jang Dong-chul and Jeon Yi-gyeong.

578
00:54:57,816 --> 00:54:59,318
Also get the testimony
from Gi Su-jong's daughter.

579
00:55:00,110 --> 00:55:01,069
What about Gi Su-jong?

580
00:55:01,570 --> 00:55:02,529
Hey!

581
00:55:03,488 --> 00:55:04,740
Why Gi Su-jong?

582
00:55:05,157 --> 00:55:06,867
To dig up more baseless claims?

583
00:55:07,659 --> 00:55:11,622
That's enough already. Come on.

584
00:55:28,347 --> 00:55:29,932
- Hello?
- Honey.

585
00:55:31,183 --> 00:55:34,645
Da-rae's been called in as a witness.

586
00:55:35,020 --> 00:55:36,313
I guess Yi-gyeong said something.

587
00:55:36,939 --> 00:55:40,609
Oh, then I need to explain things
to Da-rae so they can understand.

588
00:55:43,612 --> 00:55:44,613
Is this right?

589
00:55:46,156 --> 00:55:47,490
We should get the words straight

590
00:55:47,491 --> 00:55:49,993
so that they don't suspect us,
and Yi-gyeong will be released too.

591
00:55:54,081 --> 00:55:54,789
Da-rae's here.

592
00:55:54,790 --> 00:55:55,916
Hang up.

593
00:55:56,208 --> 00:55:57,125
Okay.

594
00:56:05,759 --> 00:56:06,468
Da-rae.

595
00:56:07,177 --> 00:56:09,012
The police called.

596
00:56:09,805 --> 00:56:11,390
They want you to come in as a witness.

597
00:56:13,850 --> 00:56:16,144
When are you going?

598
00:56:18,355 --> 00:56:19,523
Not me.

599
00:56:19,898 --> 00:56:21,066
I meant you, Da-rae.

600
00:56:25,570 --> 00:56:26,613
Are you going to be okay?

601
00:56:37,249 --> 00:56:39,543
You don't have to if it's too hard.

602
00:56:47,134 --> 00:56:51,846
No, I'm fine.
It's something I have to do

603
00:56:51,847 --> 00:56:56,560
for Aunt Yi-gyeong, too.

604
00:56:58,228 --> 00:56:59,104
Okay.

605
00:57:00,814 --> 00:57:01,940
First, let's eat.

606
00:57:03,984 --> 00:57:04,776
Eat up.

607
00:58:09,800 --> 00:58:12,426
My name is Kim Seon.

608
00:58:12,427 --> 00:58:16,013
I admit to assisting my husband,
Gi Su-jong,

609
00:58:16,014 --> 00:58:18,683
in the kidnapping of Jeon Yi-gyeong.

610
00:58:21,603 --> 00:58:23,312
Jeon Yi-gyeong's abduction was the result

611
00:58:23,313 --> 00:58:25,023
of the actions of Min Hwal-sung
and I, Gi Su-jong.

612
00:58:26,274 --> 00:58:28,193
Would you like to move this video
to the trash?

613
00:58:32,114 --> 00:58:35,242
MOVE TO TRASH

614
00:58:43,125 --> 00:58:46,253
Have a good day.

615
00:58:47,045 --> 00:58:48,337
My goodness.

616
00:58:48,338 --> 00:58:49,548
I'm dying here.

617
00:58:50,549 --> 00:58:51,882
Goodness.

618
00:58:51,883 --> 00:58:53,634
But why is this site taking so long?

619
00:58:53,635 --> 00:58:57,471
That's because
you're just too detailed.

620
00:58:57,472 --> 00:58:58,807
Yes,
I can be a bit delicate.

621
00:59:00,600 --> 00:59:02,394
- Oh, this thing...
- Oh, come on.

622
00:59:04,437 --> 00:59:06,105
What are you doing leaving this here?

623
00:59:06,106 --> 00:59:07,983
- It's raining. What if it gets wet?
- I left it there.

624
00:59:09,401 --> 00:59:12,946
Why did you leave the hoe here too?

625
00:59:16,449 --> 00:59:17,450
What is this?

626
00:59:19,035 --> 00:59:19,953
Huh?

627
00:59:24,374 --> 00:59:25,458
Call the police!

628
00:59:25,792 --> 00:59:26,835
- It's someone's hand!
- Oh!

629
00:59:27,878 --> 00:59:28,836
The phone!

630
00:59:28,837 --> 00:59:29,795
- Hurry, get the phone!
- Oh, the phone!

631
00:59:29,796 --> 00:59:31,005
Hurry up and call!
Where's the phone?

632
00:59:31,006 --> 00:59:32,631
- What? What's going on?
- What is it?

633
00:59:32,632 --> 00:59:33,800
It's a hand!

634
00:59:34,968 --> 00:59:35,886
A human hand!

635
01:00:04,706 --> 01:00:07,626
MAD CONCRETE DREAMS

636
01:00:07,918 --> 01:00:10,002
Jang Hee-ju has been found dead.

637
01:00:10,003 --> 01:00:13,005
You were with Jang Hee-ju all night
at the office.

638
01:00:13,006 --> 01:00:15,007
I need to make 30 billion.

639
01:00:15,008 --> 01:00:18,302
Without her,
Pyeong-buk Gwan will be taken care of.

640
01:00:18,303 --> 01:00:19,845
I'm here to meet Yi-gyeong.

641
01:00:19,846 --> 01:00:22,181
I think those guys might do something
to Yi-gyeong too.

642
01:00:22,182 --> 01:00:23,515
Do you think for Gyun...

643
01:00:23,516 --> 01:00:25,226
Did that person kill Gyun too?

644
01:00:25,227 --> 01:00:26,810
You knew about this?

645
01:00:26,811 --> 01:00:27,604
Got it.

646
01:00:28,063 --> 01:00:30,857
What would you think
if a friend betrayed you?

647
01:00:31,816 --> 01:00:33,401
Is it okay to just kill them?

